{"strongs": "H0447", "word": "אֱלִיאֵל", "translit": "e.li.el", "root": "אלה", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "a Levite", "definition": "אֱלִיאֵל proper name, masculine ( El is God , or my God is God ) only Chronicles \\ \\ a. two or three of David's chiefs 1Chr 11:46 ; 1Chr 11:47 ; 1Chr 12:11 . \\ \\ b. chief of Manasseh 1Chr 5:24 . \\ \\ c. two chiefs of Benjamin 1Chr 8:20 ; 1Chr 8:22 . \\ \\ d. chief of the Hebronites 1Chr 15:9 ; 1Chr 15:11 . \\ \\ e. a chief Kohathite 1Chr 6:19 = אֱלִיאָב v. 1Chr 6:12 compare אֱלִיהוּ 1Sam 1:1 . feminine a Levite 2Chr 31:13 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB436')\">BDB436</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H447')\">H447</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB435')\">BDB435</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB437')\">BDB437</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אֱלִיאֵל</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (<highlight>El is God</highlight>, or <highlight>my God is God</highlight>) only Chronicles <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> two or three of David's chiefs <ref ref=\"1Chr 11:46\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"46\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"46\" onclick=\"bcv(13,11,46)\">1Chr 11:46</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 11:47\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"47\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"47\" onclick=\"bcv(13,11,47)\">1Chr 11:47</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 12:11\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(13,12,11)\">1Chr 12:11</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> chief of Manasseh <ref ref=\"1Chr 5:24\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(13,5,24)\">1Chr 5:24</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> two chiefs of Benjamin <ref ref=\"1Chr 8:20\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(13,8,20)\">1Chr 8:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 8:22\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(13,8,22)\">1Chr 8:22</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> chief of the Hebronites <ref ref=\"1Chr 15:9\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(13,15,9)\">1Chr 15:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 15:11\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(13,15,11)\">1Chr 15:11</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> a chief Kohathite <ref ref=\"1Chr 6:19\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(13,6,19)\">1Chr 6:19</ref> = <bdbheb>אֱלִיאָב</bdbheb> v.<ref ref=\"1Chr 6:12\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(13,6,12)\">1Chr 6:12</ref> compare <bdbheb>אֱלִיהוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 1:1\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(9,1,1)\">1Sam 1:1</ref>. <b>feminine</b> <highlightword>a Levite</highlightword> <ref ref=\"2Chr 31:13\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(14,31,13)\">2Chr 31:13</ref>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "1Chr 11:46", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 11, "verse": 46}, {"raw": "1Chr 11:47", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 11, "verse": 47}, {"raw": "1Chr 12:11", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 12, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "1Chr 5:24", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 5, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "1Chr 8:20", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 8, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "1Chr 8:22", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 8, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "1Chr 15:9", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 15, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "1Chr 15:11", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 15, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "1Chr 6:19", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 6, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "1Chr 6:12", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 6, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "1Sam 1:1", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 1, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "2Chr 31:13", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 31, "verse": 13}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["אֱלִיאֵל", "אֱלִיאָב", "אֱלִיהוּ"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": []}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB436", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}